#: price-by-user-role-for-woocommerce.php
#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Set role-based product prices in WooCommerce. Apply global multipliers or "
"fixed per-product prices per role. Upgrade to Pro for rules, quantity "
"discounts, adjustment types, and more."
msgstr ""
"Stel op rollen gebaseerde productprijzen in WooCommerce in. Pas algemene "
"vermenigvuldigingsfactoren of vaste prijzen per product per rol toe. "
"Upgrade naar Pro voor regels, kwantumkortingen, aanpassingstypen en meer."

